canon: BRIEF_UNAPPROVED: unreviewed-promotion checkout — evidence for c-checkout#1: brief not approved — .canon/changes/c-checkout/brief.md has no `Approved:` line, so the human has not answered it; when they answer, show the human the brief (`canon brief show c-checkout --body`), ask them, and on their explicit approval record it with `canon brief approve c-checkout --approver <their name> --note "<their words>" --relayed-via <the question tool> --actor <your actor id> --digest c-checkout=<the digest shown>` (or the human approves on `canon dashboard`); never unset your role to run it
